{
    "title": "Eris Dating App: Meet People",
    "description": "Eris is not only an app for dating, but also a social media app to chat with new people, \r\nmeet millions of singles from all over the world and enjoy exciting live streams.\r\nWe have designed Eris perfectly for your best dating & friendship experience.\r\n\r\n<b>ERIS IS A FREE CHAT,DATING & LIVE STREAM APP</b>\r\n - Meet singles in chats, flirt, find love or enjoy free live streams\r\n - Enjoy free chat, audio & video calls, connecting new people on live streams & group chats\r\n - View your visitors, likes and followers with free membership\r\n - Use most of the premium dating services for free\r\n\r\n<b>LIVE STREAMS</b>\r\n  - Live stream your best moments, share photos and videos with your friends  \r\n  - Receive gifts from your lovers    \r\n  - Create a conference and start voice chat with people\r\n  - Find your matches & loves by using the next-match feature\r\n  - Draw on screen or use face masks to entertain your friends\r\n  - Join live streams, chat and flirt with singles\r\n  - Send gifts, stickers, audio & video messages to people\r\n  - Use free translator and speech to text features to communicate with singles from all over the world\r\n  - React to chat messages with emojis and share moments with your friends  \r\n  - Follow people & make new friends\r\n  - Record & share live streams on social media\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>PLAY GAMES WITH FRIENDS</b>  \r\n  - Start & play games with people, enjoy the competition and congratulate the winners  \r\n  - View daily top players list\r\n  - Join games and meet new people. Flirt with singles and find your love   \r\n\r\n<b>STORIES</b>\r\n  - Post your videos and photos to communities & share your best moments with your friends   \r\n  - Add animations, stickers, emojis or text messages to your story videos to attract your contacts  \r\n  - Watch videos of people, flirt with them and find your love  \r\n\r\n<b>GROUPS</b>\r\n  - Create your group and express yourself in communities. Invite your friends to join your groups \r\n  - Connect with singles all over the world in groups and find your best match\r\n  - Join group chats and share the moments with your friends\r\n  - Start live stream for your groups and enjoy video chats with your friends\r\n\r\n<b>CHAT</b>\r\n  - Use real-time free translator to chat with international people\r\n  - Add animated stickers and emoticons to your messages\r\n  - Send voice and video messages\r\n  - Start video or voice call with your contacts\r\n  - Share photos with contacts, reply & forward messages\r\n  - Show emoji reaction to messages \r\n  - Enjoy real time fast & secure chat\r\n  \r\n<b>SAFETY</b>\r\n  - All messages are encrypted on our system and we have keyword & content filter to protect our users\r\n  - You can block new contacts by using many criteria such as country, gender, age and distance-based filters\r\n\r\n\r\nIf you are just looking to chat and make friends, looking for dating or looking for your soulmate, it does not matter, you will find all of them on Eris.\r\nInstall the app on your device, create a free account and start your dating adventure with Eris!",
